ngspice-rs — NOTICE

This repository is a from-scratch Rust implementation ("the port") of ngspice,
the SPICE circuit simulator.

Upstream project:   ngspice
  https://ngspice.sourceforge.io/
  git://git.code.sf.net/p/ngspice/ngspice
Reference revision:  pre-master-48 @ 059066b53

The port is a derivative work of ngspice: it reimplements behaviour that
ngspice's C sources define, and the doc comments throughout `src/` name the
upstream file and function each piece has to match. Paths such as
`src/spicelib/parser/inpeval.c` and `src/frontend/rawfile.c` are paths **in the
upstream ngspice tree**; they are not paths in this repository, which does not
vendor the C sources.

